krellix (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Thermal sensor display: color-coded green/warn/red temperature rows
  * Fahrenheit/Celsius selectable per Sensors Settings dialog
  * Display mode: Temperature + %, Temperature only, or Percent only
  * Configurable warn (default 70°C) and critical (default 85°C) thresholds
  * Reads hardware tempN_max/tempN_crit from /sys/class/hwmon when available
  * accent_ok color key added to all bundled themes
  * macOS: thermal-pressure level percentages color-coded the same way

 -- yodabytz <hello@cerberix.org>  Sat, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000

